        dcterms:description "24-frame animated GIF comparing wild-type vs VAD bistable wavefront somite budding — docs/media/fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront_growth.gif: rendered output of 2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py at 317bc3c, image/gif, 541108 B, 940×540 px, 13 frames, artifact_sha256 9615dca1301ac38b57414fff20d1693eb00274fff068d64b385aa91aeef038fb (sha256 9615dca1301ac38b57414fff20d1693eb00274fff068d64b385aa91aeef038fb), spec_fingerprint 067326af3885ea73d93878ed07f29a5a29f47fffe07fbd95bba8a7110f414601" .

